SUMMARY:International Marcé Society Biennial Conference 2026
DESCRIPTION:The International Marcé Society biennial conference is held 
 September 6 to 9\, 2026 at the Century City Conference Centre in Cape To
 wn\, the society's first meeting in Africa. The theme is Ubuntu and the 
 event is exclusively in person.\n\nDeadlines\nPreconference workshop abs
 tract submission: 2025-11-30\nOral and poster abstract submission: 2026-
 03-15\nSymposium abstract submission: 2026-03-15\nAcceptance notificatio
 ns: 2026-05-15\nEarly registration: 2026-06-30\nPresenter registration d
 eadline: 2026-07-30\n\nhttps://marceconference2026.com/
LOCATION:Cape Town\, Western Cape\, ZA\, Century City Conference Centre
URL:https://marceconference2026.com/
